1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,445
W: We are short of staff today.

2
00:00:02,045 --> 00:00:05,445
Why don't you call up some of the part-time workers and see if they can work today?

3
00:00:06,145 --> 00:00:11,645
We are expecting a massive crowd to swarm us tonight since a great review got printed in today's local paper.

4
00:00:12,455 --> 00:00:14,185
M: Is that why we are getting so many calls?

5
00:00:14,805 --> 00:00:17,465
I couldn't figure out why the phone was ringing off the hook.

6
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:22,665
W: I didn't know about it either, but one of the customers told me that he came after reading the review.

7
00:00:23,035 --> 00:00:25,785
He also complimented us on the great food we serve here.

8
00:00:26,445 --> 00:00:27,285
M: That's good to hear.

9
00:00:27,405 --> 00:00:32,545
All the renovation work we did here and hiring the new chef we scouted from France are really paying off.
